# Per-Agent Persistent State

This directory holds **per-clone, per-agent durable state** for stateful manager agents (curator, todo-manager, prompt-manager, workflow-manager). Workers and routing agents are stateless and do not write here.

**This directory is gitignored.** State is local to each clone; it never gets pushed.

See [`.ai/agents/context.md`](../context.md) for the full context contract and which agents own state files here.

Subdirectories (created on first write by each agent):

```
.ai/agents/state/
├── curator/             # last-reconciliation.json
├── todo-manager/        # seen-todos.json
├── prompt-manager/      # last-scan.json
└── workflow-manager/    # last-scan.json
```
